  "referenceNumber": "RUS1577",
  "remarks": "\nVasiliy NOSKOV is an involved person within the meaning of the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because he is the so-called Deputy Minister of Culture, Sports and Youth for the non-government controlled area of Ukraine known as the Luhansk People’s Republic. Through this role, NOSKOV is or has engaged in policies or actions which destabilise Ukraine and undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
